        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nene Paulo nsese o ng'wa Mulungu, na ntūng'wa o ng'wa Yesu Kilisito, kūlwa kūbagunanha basolwa ba ng'wa Mulungu mu kūzunya kwabo; bayitegeleje ī ng'hana īyo yigwīndanije na wela, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kūlwa nguno ya kwisagīlwa kwa būpanga wa shiku jose, ūbo Mulungu, ūyo atīko kūlomaloma, watwisagīja kūfuma kale, kūko ikanza lītaalī kwandya kūbiza ho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna aho lyang'wa ī likanza ūgoolecha ū mhayo gokwe mu nzīla ya būlomeeji ūbo nakinhwa nene gīt'ūmo shilī shilagīlo sha ng'wa Mulungu mpīja wise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūlī Tito, ng'wana wane gete mu būsangī wa kūzunya; shigongo na mhola shibize hamò nang'ho kūfuma kūlī Mulungu Sīswe, na kūlī Seeba Yesu Kilisito Mpīja wise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.1.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Babīkījiwa ba ng'wa Mulungu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakakūleka ko ī Kilete gīkī wīgolanye ī milīmo īyo yigelile kwītwa, na gīkī ūyūtūūla banamhala mu būlī nzengo gīt'ūmo nakakūtongeelela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyo igeleelilwe kūtūūlwa ha būnamhala abize atī na shilingo, atoolile nkīma ūmò. A baana bakwe babize bazunya, na batī na lūkumo lwa būlūūlū, nūūlū būlambu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū nang'hani wa kanisa ng'wene mīkījiwa o ng'wa Mulungu, hūna lūūlū shing'wigelile abize atī na shilingo, atī wa kwiyeja wei ng'wenekīlī dūhū. Atī ng'wangū kūpelana, atī nkolwa walwa, atī ntūji banhū, nūūlū atī nchooji wa shikolo mu nzīla ja minala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo abize ng'wiza ng'holò, munhū ūyo atogilwe mihayo yawiza, ng'witegeleja, ntūngīlīja, ng'wela, ng'wilang'hani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abize agūdimile mu wishigwa ū mhayo ūmo gūhayīlile; ū mu gīko h'akūdūla kūganikīla mu kalangīle kawiza, na kūbahuumūja a bahalalī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno balīho bingī a bashitiigwa, bayombi ba mihayo ītī mu nzīla, na balomolomo ba balomolomo; ī no no no a ba ng'wigele lya basaalwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shiigelile bayūhuumūjiwa a benabo, nguno bakūhūmbūūlaga kaya ngima ja banhū, kūlwa kūlanga mihayo ya kwipandīkīla solobo mu nzīla ja minala, mhayo ūyo gūtigelile bagwīte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūmò wa bahangi babo ahayile gīkī, “A bana Kilete bene balomolomo pyī ī shikū, shiinū ja malofu, balaku ba balaku, nīyo hangī boolo!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būkaanīji wenūbū būtūngīlīgije. Hūna lūūlū bahamage na būkalī bagoloole ū kūzunya kwabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Booye ū kwikala būdegeleka ngano ja Bayudaya, na shilagīlo sha banhū abo bakwīhūbyaga ī ng'hana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye ī shikolo shilī sheela ū kū beela, alīyo ū kū basoso na bashitiigwa shitīho ī sheela, nguno a maganiko gabo masoso, pyī nū wiyangūji wa mung'holò jabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū gītī benaba batogilwe ū kwihaya gīkī bandeebile ū Mulungu, alīyo ū mu shītīle shabo banemile. Banhū ba malofu na bashitiigwa, nīyo batigeleelilwe mu nīmo gose gose ū gwawiza!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
